{"id":5342,"date":"2025-08-30T15:38:08","date_gmt":"2025-08-30T08:38:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5342"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:17:14","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:17:14","slug":"cach-lam-dropshipping-tren-amazon","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-amazon\/cach-lam-dropshipping-tren-amazon\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch l\u00e0m dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon t\u1eeb A-Z d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QmzddF1fAoenE5xdLdQl6xJrghg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dropshipping t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh online h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5t nh\u1edd t\u00ednh linh ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1ed1n ban \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea5p. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh n\u00e0y v\u1edbi Amazon &#8211; s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t h\u00e0nh tinh, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i lo l\u1eafng v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c l\u01b0u kho hay v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. Tuy nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng. Trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd cung c\u1ea5p m\u1ed9t l\u1ed9 tr\u00ecnh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng t\u1eeb A-Z c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon, gi\u00fap nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 tin tri\u1ec3n khai m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QPixdaB5Mov4RhxEUyjlBzKngrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec v\u00e0 c\u00f3 h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-BjMOdsfAVodw1exiJShlMbgbgKc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0bd9ca6e-42c8-4892-9dc8-615a578a298e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZWCNbmVRYopCYzxdcavlIhIPgwB%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZWCNbmVRYopCYzxdcavlIhIPgwB&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:363246,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0bd9ca6e-42c8-4892-9dc8-615a578a298e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZWCNbmVRYopCYzxdcavlIhIPgwB%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZWCNbmVRYopCYzxdcavlIhIPgwB&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:363246,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5343\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5343\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5343\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc.png\" alt=\"M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/fe4d336a-53b7-44c1-b9b5-6940063e07cc-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5343\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T0s0diBHTohfBHxVJtwlW1FXgAe\"><strong>Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh m\u00e0 \u1edf \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u00ean gian h\u00e0ng Amazon c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 s\u1edf h\u1eefu hay l\u01b0u tr\u1eef h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a. Khi c\u00f3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7t mua, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd chuy\u1ec3n th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng n\u00e0y cho m\u1ed9t nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba, v\u00e0 h\u1ecd s\u1ebd l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. L\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n ch\u00eanh l\u1ec7ch gi\u1eefa gi\u00e1 b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n tr\u00ean Amazon v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 b\u1ea1n tr\u1ea3 cho nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KSvrdGytnoC1UoxfBZwlxXzfglh\">V\u1ec1 t\u00ednh h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p, <strong>dropshipping ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p tr\u00ean Amazon<\/strong>, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t c\u00e1c quy t\u1eafc m\u00e0 h\u1ecd \u0111\u1eb7t ra. Amazon mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd lu\u00f4n c\u00f3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPZrdkolRofPZcx75URlomlYgac\"><strong>C\u00e1c quy t\u1eafc b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ClxZd0vCMoh5OTxqfwXlSp6agrV\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> M\u1ecdi gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd, h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n, phi\u1ebfu \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i ph\u1ea3i ghi r\u00f5 th\u00f4ng tin c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A4kFd1yGvo0zZTxU6qkl1DzNghd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng, ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBNYdJgzlozo5yx0DrelfmyjgSb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u1ea5m mua h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n l\u1ebb kh\u00e1c v\u00e0 giao tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n l\u1ebb kh\u00e1c (nh\u01b0 Walmart, eBay) v\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u h\u1ecd giao h\u00e0ng cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean Amazon. B\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t ho\u1eb7c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n bu\u00f4n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-B1ZLdlIhjowIK1xUZhZlTRtwgWf\">\u01afu v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Dropshipping Amazon<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FVUzdW2Nwo7HjUxBMyHloL8lgeb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d0bdd042-a34c-4427-91b2-fde06133be41&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAkcGbZbTwo34gJxSe9hlG7gXgJb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AkcGbZbTwo34gJxSe9hlG7gXgJb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:281210,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d0bdd042-a34c-4427-91b2-fde06133be41&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAkcGbZbTwo34gJxSe9hlG7gXgJb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AkcGbZbTwo34gJxSe9hlG7gXgJb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:281210,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5344\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5344\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5344\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a.png\" alt=\"\u01afu v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Dropshipping Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/222a6e2b-86f7-47ea-b8cc-544eab1ba13a-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5344\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u01afu v\u00e0 nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Dropshipping Amazon<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-TVYWdFIH8ozST4xt3mvlOPwJguf\">\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKVFdn73uoHUpqxe05LlwykXgxg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>V\u1ed1n kh\u1edfi \u0111i\u1ec3m th\u1ea5p:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i b\u1ecf ra m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u kho.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LanmdTOFEomL32x6YA7lAzhMg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u:<\/strong> R\u00e0o c\u1ea3n gia nh\u1eadp th\u1ea5p, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc m\u00e1y t\u00ednh v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i internet.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DCd2dA93qoQNaqxL3PelJ31YgVb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m chi ph\u00ed kho b\u00e3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i lo l\u1eafng v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c thu\u00ea kho, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u1ed3n kho hay \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HzTJdhyeZok2MkxL3WslVOqKgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn l\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng kh\u1ed5ng l\u1ed3:<\/strong> T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp c\u1ef1c l\u1edbn t\u1eeb Amazon \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjGRdv6lVo0m4JxFVjOlXiBvg2f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>M\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 kinh doanh d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Khi \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh KOL hay KOC cho 1 l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u00eam c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng doanh thu cho c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, khi m\u1ecdi ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p x\u1eed l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BQ0ZdseIQoXzGcxpHjylMC8Agjf\">Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PZb0dhxjSoRnlJxEEIilYPjQgtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u1ea1nh tranh r\u1ea5t cao:<\/strong> C\u00f3 h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n kh\u00e1c c\u0169ng \u0111ang kinh doanh c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0etdXRZQoJuqqxlOR3lN4SygFh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n v\u00e0o nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p:<\/strong> Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng n\u1eb1m ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea7m ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea1n l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m tr\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OCWMdXv0BoCvCgx8BBelFXVXgHg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Bi\u00ean l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng cao:<\/strong> Do c\u1ea1nh tranh, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 b\u00e1n th\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8bXdYR1WoDNFfxHFZEl0aj4gHc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Kh\u00f3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ri\u00eang:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n do b\u00ean th\u1ee9 ba th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n khi\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n kh\u00f3 t\u1ea1o ra tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NShadq8RvoaRhAxmBKzlcVdAg1g\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon chi ti\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-P9bxdjckbot1ijxdy9VluSXRghh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 t\u00ecm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5pMd6HK5ofuv3xlUaJlZVDRgre\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t, quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ebfn 80% th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ea1y theo c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00e0, h\u00e3y t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng ng\u00e1ch (niche product). S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 <strong>Jungle Scout<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>Helium 10<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm cao nh\u01b0ng m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u1eeba ph\u1ea3i, v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 c\u1ea1nh tranh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;caf85d86-bb81-4911-8060-35535e51179b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FE3nvb7WK0o3DbdxlUDzly2CKgqf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;E3nvb7WK0o3DbdxlUDzly2CKgqf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:564671,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5345\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5345\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5345\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787.png\" alt=\"Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 t\u00ecm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2d01eb0c-829f-4538-88de-57fc82e34787-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5345\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 t\u00ecm s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-VkhPdxCdBoOxZNxNNeclnF6AgMb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p uy t\u00edn<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GxDBdH1ewoBPJNxnQs1lJtjGgUz\">Nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 x\u01b0\u01a1ng s\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh dropshipping. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm h\u1ecd tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng B2B l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 <strong>Alibaba, AliExpress, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c danh b\u1ea1 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n bu\u00f4n uy t\u00edn<\/strong>. C\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p bao g\u1ed3m: uy t\u00edn (d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng), ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf, gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bdd548f4-1ebe-42c3-9b63-09b6c28440c5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FB2tZbuiCPoUJF4xK7ppl4sLHgAe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;B2tZbuiCPoUJF4xK7ppl4sLHgAe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:491374,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5346\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5346\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5346\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f.png\" alt=\"T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p uy t\u00edn\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/752d89ad-736e-40cb-86f2-e62cd571338f-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5346\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p uy t\u00edn<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-RBELdD6ZZom25AxzRAIln34igUf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Seller<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXtRd3G3xoff4DxOQgxlibZRgHd\">B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd m\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p (Professional Seller Account) tr\u00ean Amazon. Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n\/doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u1ebb thanh to\u00e1n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf (Visa\/Mastercard) \u0111\u1ec3 Amazon tr\u1eeb c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;395ee343-31fc-4b3c-a33b-9b7abcbae580&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWCGybwysTotz83xJ3ZulWhBcg0g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WCGybwysTotz83xJ3ZulWhBcg0g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:209862,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5347\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5347\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5347\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Seller\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a6efcb49-b4e0-4794-92a5-9c638b0f9a5f-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5347\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon Seller<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EERodBntIokncPxFS5llzY5ogt4\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: \u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean Amazon<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lrfkd2xdEolYqMxBsNhlYlMyg2d\">Vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m (listing) h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n SEO l\u00e0 c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c vi\u1ebft ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee9a c\u00e1c t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qwn0dHLiyoME3VxjtM9ljf2kg7d\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi nhi\u1ec1u k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p ngay t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u, vi\u1ec7c t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. C\u00e1c agency nh\u01b0 <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> cung c\u1ea5p <strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp Gian h\u00e0ng<\/strong>, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n bi\u00ean t\u1eadp n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chu\u1ea9n SEO, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-JaQLduZxVoUEEyxssrGlhQ48gvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2e7e05da-46be-4115-8aa8-3b7332522323&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRekXblbkWo3Ehqxm58El8tGlgzf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RekXblbkWo3Ehqxm58El8tGlgzf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:449903,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2e7e05da-46be-4115-8aa8-3b7332522323&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRekXblbkWo3Ehqxm58El8tGlgzf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RekXblbkWo3Ehqxm58El8tGlgzf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:449903,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5348\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5348\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5348\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/4db2c2eb-8294-43f3-b297-27dfbcbb520b-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5348\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>\u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean Amazon<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-MtmBdzVbeotAZMxcsnklPC27gMh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JyRmdN9etofiQAxIaL8l0p4qgEf\">Khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd chuy\u1ec3n th\u00f4ng tin cho nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p. Nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a quy tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y. Song song \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i lu\u00f4n s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi c\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi, gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft c\u00e1c khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh t\u1ed1t tr\u00ean Amazon.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-YYm7d7VIkoCuFgxQrSflOK33ggh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9c73dee3-8f2c-4cb8-8786-0e64473fcb57&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAcxYb4yfjoHj6GxwdSXlpbzEgde%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AcxYb4yfjoHj6GxwdSXlpbzEgde&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:346555,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9c73dee3-8f2c-4cb8-8786-0e64473fcb57&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAcxYb4yfjoHj6GxwdSXlpbzEgde%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AcxYb4yfjoHj6GxwdSXlpbzEgde&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:346555,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5349\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5349\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5349\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303.png\" alt=\"X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/a43a55ac-80b4-4347-9086-1d8e4bb7e303-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5349\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"U2AAduQcRoj4wgxaS4clPPuzgzc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K4v2d9WzwoFjmdxejhglZbCAgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 Dropshipping Amazon<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZYYidIjApodyn0xr8Q0loD28goh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Jungle Scout, Helium 10.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRrQdwTIpoas9TxhbxYlQV0cgHh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111a k\u00eanh:<\/strong> Sellbrite, Ecomdash.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IlPOdgxEMonHbYxWSwWlqxtpgpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> DS Amazon Quick View.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KmeedrMgLoRBBlxZufDllvlYgQh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p (FAQs)<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-N9JtdD35noMHksxRnlBlFjyHghh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>N\u00ean b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u dropshipping Amazon v\u1edbi bao nhi\u00eau ti\u1ec1n?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RxBQdGMPbo4hnyxyVAKlt7A6gog\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n nh\u1eadp h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch ban \u0111\u1ea7u (kho\u1ea3ng v\u00e0i tr\u0103m \u0111\u1ebfn v\u00e0i ngh\u00ecn USD) \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Amazon, chi ph\u00ed cho c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ban \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-T9lxdsKTso9fnAxNdP6lywh0gTg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00f3 c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kinh doanh \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m dropshipping Amazon kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7T4dq1rzobGGrxWi1ZlEqyCg7b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a qu\u1ed1c gia b\u1ea1n \u0111ang sinh s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 quy m\u00f4 kinh doanh. Tuy nhi\u00ean, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kinh doanh s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i h\u01a1n trong c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 v\u1ec1 thu\u1ebf v\u00e0 ph\u00e1p l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-C2VDd2chpoKqvJxYHallE0ZrgZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u00e0m sao \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p t\u1ed1t?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S658dwTk9oKRS3xQYWTl6MG9gab\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u00e3y lu\u00f4n ki\u1ec3m tra k\u1ef9 c\u00e1c \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1, y\u00eau c\u1ea7u xem m\u1eabu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 trao \u0111\u1ed5i r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-AXbudX1bSoK3xKxcUtVlroUDgYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>M\u1ea5t bao l\u00e2u th\u00ec c\u00f3 l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GAGIdfn7bodqWtx5NftlTMXMgqh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 nh\u01b0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn, chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c marketing v\u00e0 n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1ea5t v\u00e0i th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CkEndFzu3oB3iBxL4U7lSt4MgUc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dropshipping tr\u00ean Amazon l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i kinh doanh \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng \u0111i k\u00e8m v\u1edbi kh\u00f4ng \u00edt th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SvIgdzUD0oAFUgxBtB3lHQ4Fgdf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital \u0111\u00e3 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m dropshipping tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T s\u1ed1 1 th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RdAXdorRno4gGOxTaJTlicgGg2g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng, m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u00ean tr\u00ec. Vi\u1ec7c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 am hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 marketing.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LsOPdKCrGoua44xSzh1lkH3HgNd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QG2NdmEsioWl1sxc3v2lAGTIgOb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvgednYUeoQTV3xcn1nlMlm9g1e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdqNduJSIoN6iUxu2cclZbitgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y1nOdnhocoZHGQx3FvJlIztKgXc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Csg1dI8GfosNDexEnOWllMYvgxb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A1pfdSshJoZWFlxvwiDlEE3dgQd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dropshipping t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh kinh doanh online h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5t nh\u1edd t\u00ednh linh ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1ed1n ban \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ea5p. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh n\u00e0y v\u1edbi Amazon &#8211; s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t h\u00e0nh tinh, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5709,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[31,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5342","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-amazon","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5342","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5342"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5342\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5407,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5342\/revisions\/5407"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5709"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/l